* text=auto eol=lf
*.rs diff=rust
*.md diff=markdown
# Branches only append to these two: in a local merge, a union merge keeps both
# sides' lines instead of a conflict (GitHub's server-side merge is expected
# not to apply it; pull requests no longer edit CHANGELOG.md, ADR-0088). Never
# for files whose lines are edited in place (crate cards, design docs): union
# would keep the old and the new line
# (docs/agents/workflow.md#merging-parallel-branches).
docs/adr/README.md merge=union
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
